{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019m8fj8JwmVsBghWk9qmS9u","type":"tool_result","content":"total 1920\ndrwxr-xr-x 8 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 .\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 ..\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  114712 Nov  4 07:03 AI_GUIDE.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  192446 Nov  4 07:03 API-INDEX.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha   67603 Nov  4 07:03 API.md\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    6295 Nov  4 07:03 README.md\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 docs\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 game\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha    6981 Nov  4 07:03 index.html\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 kits\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 modules\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha  293108 Nov  4 07:03 my-3d2dge-agent.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha 1234180 Nov  4 07:03 my-3d2dge.js\n-rw-r--r-- 1 micha micha     375 Nov  4 07:03 package.json\ndrwxr-xr-x 3 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 src\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 micha micha    4096 Nov  4 07:03 tools\ndocs:\nASSETS.md\n\ngame:\ngame.js\nindex.html\ntest.mjs\n\nkits:\nREADME.md\nadventure.html\nadventure.js\nanimlab.html\nanimlab.js\narcade.html\narcade.js\nartillery.html\nartillery.js\nbrawler.html\nbrawler.js\nfighting.html\nfighting.js\nkart.html\nkart.js\nmetroidvania.html\nmetroidvania.js\npinball.html\npinball.js\nplatformer.html\nplatformer.js\npointclick.html\npointclick.js\npuzzle.html\npuzzle.js\nrhythm.html\nrhythm.js\nroad.html\nroad.js\nroguelike.html\nroguelike.js\nrpg.html\nrpg.js\nrts.html\nrts.js\nshooter.html\nshooter.js\nsim.html\nsim.js\nsports.html\nsports.js\nstealth.html\nstealth.js\ntactics.html\ntactics.js\ntest.mjs\n\ntools:\nasset-find.mjs\nasset-lib.mjs\nasset-set.mjs\nasset-sheet.mjs\ncheck.mjs\nfilmstrip.mjs\nreplay.mjs\n1234180 my-3d2dge.js\n  67603 API.md\n 192446 API-INDEX.md\n 114712 AI_GUIDE.md\n  11643 docs/ASSETS.md\n1620584 total\n# my-3D2dge handoff package (v0.85.2)\n\nEverything a coding agent needs to build, run, test and check a game on the full my-3D2dge engine, in one folder of text\nfiles. You don't need the engine's repository, and you don't need to read the engine's source below its header.\n\n**The engine is yours to change.** This copy is yours to fix, extend or rewrite in any way you see fit: `my-3d2dge.js`\nis the engine, readable, with every module, and every page and test here loads it (`modules/` and `my-3d2dge-agent.js`\nare separate copies). If you hand the game back, a line on what you changed and why helps: it shows what the engine\nlacks.\n\n## Start here\n\n1. **Read `API.md`**, the API card: a complete game to start from, what x, y and z mean in each view, the rules, the\n   common mistakes and the API by area. It is the one page to read whole.\n2. **Start from a game, not an empty file.** The kit for your genre (`kits/`): the card's Genre playbook names one for\n   each genre, and `kits/README.md` says which file is which. `kits/<id>.js` is a complete game in that genre, readable\n   (its title, play and end, the modules it rests on, sound, touch controls), `kits/<id>.html` plays it, and\n   `node kits/test.mjs <id>` runs it headless. Or the template, `game/`: a small complete game (climbing, a guard with\n   sight, an HTML HUD, scenes) that `game/index.html` plays and `game/test.mjs` tests without a browser. Copy one into\n   `game/` and make it yours.\n3. **Search `API-INDEX.md`** when you need a name: every public name in the engine, one line each, with its signature,\n   units and defaults, and the height rules at the top. `grep -n \"ledge\\|landing\" API-INDEX.md`. Don't read it whole.\n4. **`AI_GUIDE.md`** has the recipes: genre by genre, the look to aim for, the frame order, heights, recorded sessions.\n5. **Don't build a pause menu, settings, key rebinding, full screen or a loading screen**: every game has them (`API.md`,\n   \"Standard features\"). Adjust them with `new E.Game({ menu: { items, settings, controls, quit } })`; heavy setup goes in\n   `game.start({ boot: { steps } })`.\n6. **Objects without drawing code:** read `docs/ASSETS.md` whole before you draw a barrel, a table or a tree.\n   `r.shape('barrel', x, y, 0, { facing })` draws one of the core library's in every view; `node tools/asset-find.mjs\n   \"market stall\"` searches it and the store (`src/assets/sets/`: about a thousand objects, materials and sprites,\n   each with where it came from), and `node tools/asset-sheet.mjs mine.js#stool` draws one you wrote, to look at\n../../../hub/lib/hub:\nREADME.md\nbridge.js\nexamples\nharness.html\nretrofit.md\nround.js\nsession.js\n\n../../../hub/lib/hub/examples:\narena.html\nghost.html\nparallel.html\n../../src/mocap:\ncatalogs\nmocap.js\nreadable.js\nsets\n\n../../tools:\nagent-bench\nagent-bench.mjs\nagent-test.mjs\nanim-import.mjs\nanim-set.mjs\nanim-sheet.mjs\napi-index-lookups.json\napi-index.mjs\nasf-amc.mjs\nasset-fetch.mjs\nasset-find.mjs\nasset-import.mjs\nasset-lib.mjs\nasset-set.mjs\nasset-sheet.mjs\nassets-test.mjs\naudio-test.mjs\nbuild.mjs\ncharacter-check.mjs\ncheck.mjs\ncmu.mjs\ncontract-test.mjs\ncross-engine-math.cjs\ndeterminism-test.mjs\ndiet.mjs\ndoctrine-check.mjs\ned-balance.mjs\ned-build.mjs\ned-character-test.mjs\ned-clips-test.mjs\ned-codex-showcase.mjs\ned-codex-test.mjs\ned-controls-test.mjs\ned-play.mjs\ned-scenes-test.mjs\ned-sheet.mjs\ned-smoke.mjs\ned-syntax.mjs\ned-tune-test.mjs\nengine-lib.mjs\nfight-test.mjs\nfilmstrip.mjs\nfixtures\nhandoff.mjs\nkit3d-test.mjs\nkits-test.mjs\nlabs-test.mjs\nmocap-lib.mjs\nmocap-test.mjs\nmodules-test.mjs\nmotion-test.mjs\nnew-character.mjs\nphone-test.mjs\nplayers-test.mjs\nreplay-test.mjs\nreplay.mjs\nstamp.mjs\nstandard-test.mjs\nstress-test.mjs\ntest-run.mjs\nto-glb.py\ntraversal-test.mjs\nvendor-3d.mjs\nversion.mjs\nviews-test.mjs","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1931e3d-b97b-4f9d-8b9d-c7660f7740b5","uuid":"782786c1-1d32-46e1-8d91-254d19eef5fe","timestamp":"2026-11-04T14:03:10.140Z","tool_use_r