AP A HAND-KNITTED SCARF'], ['say', 'lou', 'He knits, Chet. The big fella knits.'], ['reward', 'MASCOT_MAYHEM']] },\n    ch4_loss: { steps: [['say', 'bluster', 'Frozen solid. Thaw out and run it back!']] },\n    ch5_intro: { set: 'press', team: 'dynasty', cast: [['brock', -20, 0], ['mountain', 20, 0], ['sterling', -60, 10], ['hap', 90, 20], ['pearl', 120, 20]], flashes: true,\n      steps: [['card', 'CHAPTER 5: THE FIASCO BOWL'], ['say', 'chet', 'THE FIASCO BOWL! SEVENTY THOUSAND FANS AND ONE BULLDOZER!'],\n        ['say', 'brock', 'I\\'ve got a golden arm, a golden helmet, and a golden future.'], ['say', 'brock', 'You\\'ve got... pickles.'],\n        ['say', 'hap', 'And you\\'ve never been hit by a guy who hauls pickle barrels for a living.'],\n        ['say', 'mountain', 'I will fall on you. Like a mountain. Because I am THE MOUNTAIN.'],\n        ['say', 'sterling', 'Win and keep your little field, Pearl. Lose, and the bulldozer\\'s warming up.'],\n        ['say', 'pearl', 'Warm it up all you like, Montgomery. It\\'s gonna be a long, cold night.']] },\n    ch5_half: { set: 'locker', team: 'dynasty', cast: [['pearl', 0, 0], ['bluster', 40, 10], ['hap', -40, 10]],\n      steps: [['say', 'pearl', 'Ninety-nine losses taught us one thing: how to get back up.'], ['say', 'bluster', 'So get back up! What\\'s the plan?', { expr: 'shout' }], ['choice', 'THE SECOND-HALF PLAN']] },\n    ch5_win: { set: 'field', stadium: 'megadome', ceremony: true, cast: [['bluster', 0, 10], ['hap', 30, 0], ['pearl', -30, 0], ['sterling', 70, -20], ['brock', 100, -10], ['wheels', 50, 20]], team: true,\n      steps: [['fx', 'confetti'], ['say', 'chet', 'THE TUMBLEWEED FIASCOS ARE FIASCO CUP CHAMPIONS! I NEED TO SIT DOWN!'], ['say', 'lou', 'You ARE sitting down, Chet.'],\n        ['fx', 'bucket'], ['say', 'bluster', 'AAAAH! IT\\'S ORANGE! WHY IS IT ALWAYS ORANGE?!', { expr: 'shout' }],\n        ['say', 'sterling', 'This is a... a FIASCO!', { expr: 'angry' }], ['fx', 'cake'],\n        ['say', 'pearl', 'Keep your bulldozer, Montgomery. We\\'re keeping our field.'],\n        ['say', 'brock', '...Hey. Rookie. Nice arm.'], ['say', 'hap', 'Nice cake, Brock.'],\n        ['card', 'TUMBLEWEED FIELD, ONE YEAR LATER.  ATTENDANCE: SOLD OUT.'], ['fx', 'chant'], ['reward', 'TROPHY']] },\n    ch5_loss: { steps: [['say', 'sterling', 'Start the engines!'], ['say', 'bluster', 'Not today! Run it back!', { expr: 'shout' }]] }\n  },\n  lossLines: { ch2: 'We got mud in places mud shouldn\\'t go. Again!', ch3: 'Somebody turn the lights back on in your heads! Again!', ch4: 'Frozen solid. Thaw out and run it back!', ch5: 'Not today! Run it back!' }\n};\n})();\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01G4wdUcUomPLLrLLKf6LRNF","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
