ed: pads, numbers, the carried ball, mascot heads, pom-poms, ref stripes.\"],\n    [\"E4 Football helmet\", \"A 'football' hat: shell, stripe, ear logo and a facemask drawn over the face.\"],\n    [\"E5 Dialog voice\", \"E.Dialog's voice may be a function per typed letter, for the babble synth.\"],\n    [\"E6 Audio buses\", \"audio.bus(name) and busVol(name, v): voices and the crowd on their own volumes.\"],\n    [\"E7 Setting rows\", \"Any Shell screen may list setting rows; Dev groups stay off the Settings screen.\"],\n    [\"E8 Non-pausing menu\", \"game.menu('settings', { pause: false }) for shared-world sessions.\"],\n    [\"E10 Floor cache\", \"14 baked floors kept instead of 6, for zoom steps, the Kick Cams and replay angles.\"]\n  ]\n}\n"}}}
